                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/NomuraSO12GUT.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#ChiangNomuraSato11
              %p
                Cheng-Wei Chiang,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Takaaki+Nomura"} Takaaki Nomura
                %em
                  Gauge-Higgs unification models in six dimensions with
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi S
                          %mn 2
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                        %msub
                          %mi ℤ
                          %mn 2
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^2/\mathbb{Z}_2
                  extra space and GUT gauge symmetry
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.5835"}> arXiv:1109.5835
                )
          %h3#in_string_theory_2 In string theory
          %p
            Discussion of the Higgs field from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+D-brane+models"} intersecting D-brane models
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#IbanezMarchesanoRabadan01
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luis+Ib%C3%A1%C3%B1ez"}> Luis Ibáñez
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fernando+Marchesano"} Fernando Marchesano
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Getting just the Standard Model at Intersecting Branes
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0105155"} arXiv:hep-th/0105155
            %li#CremadesIbanezMarchesano02
              %p
                D. Cremades,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luis+Ib%C3%A1%C3%B1ez"} Luis Ibáñez
                = succeed "," do
